Feature addition: mobile pinch-to-zoom prompt and portrait/landscape orientation flow.

This commit modifies 3 files (+256/-2 lines), spanning 1 networking, 1 UI/HUD, 1 Markdown docs.
This feature extends the Geometry Wars 3D codebase with new functionality. The implementation follows the project's established patterns and maintains compatibility with both single-player and multiplayer code paths where applicable.

Additional context from the commit body:
- src/ui/MobileOnboarding.ts (new): showOrientationPrompt(), showPinchZoomHint(), runMobileOnboarding()
  - Orientation prompt: full-screen overlay with animated phone emoji, auto-dismisses on rotate to landscape
  - Pinch-to-zoom hint: bottom-bar overlay, tap to dismiss, localStorage-persisted (shows once per device)
  - runMobileOnboarding() sequences both prompts: orientation first, then pinch hint after landscape
- src/network-main.ts: import + call runMobileOnboarding() after hideGameLoading() when mobile=true

Both prompts are no-ops on desktop clients (gated by isMobile()).
